          <definition>conserver les relations mutuelles</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠡᠪ ᠭᠣᠯᠢ ᠎ᠶᠢ ᠵᠤᠵᠠᠭᠠᠲᠬᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <definition>consolider les anciens usages</definition>
        </example>
